  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.06 \"RACT-applicable multicategory stationary VOC source\" means any multicategory stationary VOC source meeting the applicability criteria of Env-A 1222.01(a).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
